The lab-mail spec settles that Pat's mail client stays out of it for
now, but the work that decision defers has no home. A thread drops
out of the inbox once it has a reply, so the list alone would lose
it. todo.org is where Pat already looks for work, and the entry names
the event that should trigger it.
